  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "痛痛痛………<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n哎呀，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要來幫我找東西嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75DB75DB75DB20262026202600100001BE01000A54CE5440FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B389814F865E6B6211627E6771897F55CEFF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我啊……不小心在這個安息墓地\n把戒指弄丟了。痛痛痛……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211554A202620264E0D5C0F5FC357289019500B5B89606F58935730000A628A621263075F044E1F4E86300275DB75DB75DB2026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正當我在掃墓的時候，\n野生寶可夢突然衝了出來，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n害我嚇得摔了一跤……真是的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B6375766211572863835893768466425019FF0C000A91CE751F5BF653EF59227A817136885D4E8651FA4F86FF0C00100001BE00000A5BB3621156875F9764544E864E008DE420262026771F662F7684FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都是因為城市裡的野生寶可夢變多，\n墓地成了野生特區，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n才會發生我弄丟了戒指這種事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD662F56E070BA57CE5E0288E1768491CE751F5BF653EF59228B8A591AFF0C000A5893573062104E8691CE751F72795340FF0C00100001BE00000A624D6703767C751F62115F044E1F4E866212630790197A2E4E8BFF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那時候衝出來的一定是\n叫做勾魂眼的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n牠的弱點好像只有妖精屬性，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳遇到牠的時候記得要小心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A366425019885D51FA4F8676844E005B9A662F000A53EB505A52FE9B42773C76845BF653EF5922300200100001BE01000A726076845F319EDE597D50CF53EA670959967CBE5C6C6027FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39047523072607684664250198A185F9789815C0F5FC3300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我弄丟戒指的地方應該是在\n安息墓地的深處。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去找戒指的時候要注意喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F044E1F621263077684573065B961C98A72662F5728000A5B89606F5893573076846DF18655300200100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB627E6212630776846642501989816CE8610F5594300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那隻勾魂眼……\n似乎拿著委託人的戒指。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A396BB52FE9B42773C20262026000A4F3C4E4E62FF845759D48A174EBA76846212630730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要向牠挑起對戰\n來拿回戒指嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815411726063118D775C0D6230000A4F8662FF56DE6212630755CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D6230FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不對戰",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5C0D62300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "眼咪～！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "773C54AAFF5EFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "勾魂眼放下紀念戒指離開了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52FE9B42773C653E4E0B7D005FF56212630796E2958B4E86300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "紀念戒指在勾魂眼的手上。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D005FF562126307572852FE9B42773C7684624B4E0A300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把戒指拿去給委託人吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A6212630762FF53BB7D6659D48A174EBA5427FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的委託處理得如何了？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n戒指沒有被野生寶可夢吃掉，\n或是被糟蹋吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768459D48A17865574065F9759824F554E86FF1F00100001BE01000A621263076C92670988AB91CE751F5BF653EF592254036389FF0C000A6216662F88AB7CDF8E4B5427FF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀？\n那是我的戒指！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF1F000A90A3662F6211768462126307FF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把紀念戒指交給對方了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A7D005FF5621263074EA47D665C0D65B94E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦，是嗎？\n勾魂眼牠……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF0C662F55CEFF1F000A52FE9B42773C72602026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明明是野生寶可夢卻看上了我的戒指，\n還挺有眼光的嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E662F91CE751F5BF653EF5922537B770B4E0A4E866211768462126307FF0C000A9084633A6709773C51497684561B300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但這是從我丈夫那裡收到的結婚戒指，\n現在還不能送給牠呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F469019662F5F9E62114E08592B90A388E16536523076847D505A5A62126307FF0C000A73FE572890844E0D80FD90017D6672605462300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝。\n這是給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的謝禮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D3002000A9019662F7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B376848B1D79AE300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會拜託人在我離世以後\n把戒指放在墳墓上的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670362DC8A174EBA5728621196E24E164EE55F8C000A628A62126307653E572858B358934E0A7684300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這麼一來，或許勾魂眼\n會把戒指再次拿走。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199EBC4E004F86FF0C62168A3152FE9B42773C000A6703628A62126307518D6B2162FF8D70300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但這樣能讓牠開心，所以沒關係。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果有眼光的話，\n即使是野生寶可夢也該認可牠才對！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690196A2380FD8B937260958B5FC3FF0C62404EE56C9295DC4FC2300200100001BE01000A5982679C6709773C514976848A71FF0C000A53734F7F662F91CE751F5BF653EF59224E5F8A728A8D53EF7260624D5C0DFF0100100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果勾魂眼牠能珍惜我的回憶，\n那就太棒了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C52FE9B42773C726080FD73CD60DC6211768456DE61B6FF0C000A90A35C31592A68D24E86300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    }
  ],
